            "level": {
                "value": 14
            },
            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Wild hunt hounds are intelligent hunters and expert trackers that take the lead against elusive prey. Between hunts, they challenge themselves by seeking out creatures that are notoriously difficult to track. Wild hunt hounds are always surrounded by swirling green mist composed of fragments of their victims' spirits, a mystic fog that, at the hound's command, forms itself into a spectral pack to fight at their side.</p><hr /><p>Although some believe the wild hunt is nothing more than legend, the riders of the hunt are very real, comprised of countless lithe, horned humanoids, along with their steeds and hunting hounds. The term \"wild hunt\" refers to these fey as a whole, as well as to individual groups who gather at a wild hunt monarch's call to pursue their chosen quarry. The less dangerous a quarry, the more likely a monarch will impose rules to make the hunt more entertaining.</p>",
            "publication": {
